        "**量.** 卡路里简称为卡."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当然也同样可以说，1卡就是使1克水温度降低$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$时，",
        "它所失去的热量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个更大一些的热量单位——千卡也同样在使用着，1千",
        "卡$=1000$卡."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，热量的测量单位有："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1焦耳、1千焦耳、1卡、1千卡.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这几种单位之间的换算关系是："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1千卡$=1000$卡，1卡$=4.19$焦耳$\\approx4.2$焦耳.**",
        "**1千焦耳$=1000$焦耳，1千卡$=4190$焦耳$\\approx4200$焦耳.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）测量内能和热量所用的单位有哪些？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）什么是卡？什么是千卡？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）1千卡等于多少焦耳？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "92. 比热"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "使1千克水的温度升高$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$所需的热量是4200焦耳或",
        "1千卡. 但若使1千克别的物质的温度也升高$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$所需要的",
        "热量就不再是这么多了（参看§90）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "使单位质量（1克或1千克）的某种物质温度升高$1^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$所",
        "需的热量叫做这种物质的**比热**. 物质的比热用字母$c$来表",
        "示，其量度单位是",
        "$\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{千克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}$、$\\frac{\\text{千卡}}{\\text{千克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}$或$\\frac{\\text{卡}}{\\text{克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}$."
      ]
    },
